Error [jet.DriverOperationFailed]: Can't read the Core source parts `{work}/empty/Compiler/Prelude/CoreSourceParts.tsv`
 Why: Jet could not complete the named file, tool, or operating-system operation
 Fix: Set `JET_TOOLCHAIN_ROOT` to the Jet toolchain source tree, and keep its `Compiler/Prelude/CoreSourceParts.tsv` rows whole
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2105
